    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Favored Enemy (vermin) class feature</p><p>The blue mage gains DR/— equal to half her favored enemy (vermin) bonus against vermin and creatures with the swarm subtype. When attempting Fortitude saves against a swarm's distraction ability, she gains a bonus on the save equal to the damage prevented by this talent. Against vermin with the swarm subtype, the amount of damage reduction is equal to her full favored enemy (vermin) bonus. This damage reduction does not stack with that from other sources.</p>",
